{
  "id": "quit-smoking-free-10",
  "voiceId": "zh-cn-yunxi",
  "edgeVoice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "rate": "-42%",
  "pitch": "-12Hz",
  "totalSec": 289,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "欢迎。",
      "file": "c000.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.688
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "这个练习是为你作为非吸烟者而设的。",
      "file": "c001.ogg",
      "durationSec": 6.456
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "找一个舒适的坐姿，或躺下如果感觉更好。",
      "file": "c002.ogg",
      "durationSec": 7.392
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "让双手放松。",
      "file": "c003.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.504
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "放松眼睛，或闭上。",
      "file": "c004.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.752
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "缓慢吸气。",
      "file": "c005.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.312
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "然后缓慢呼气。",
      "file": "c006.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.936
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "[暂停:16]",
      "file": "c007.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.344
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "感受身体被支撑。",
      "file": "c008.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.984
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "无需证明。无需匆忙。",
      "file": "c009.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.616
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "[暂停:16]",
      "file": "c010.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.344
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "我们将使用清晰的自由声明。",
      "file": "c011.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.424
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "倾听，或在内心默默重复那些真实的话。",
      "file": "c012.ogg",
      "durationSec": 7.2
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c013.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "我现在是一个非吸烟者。",
      "file": "c014.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.344
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "[暂停:16]",
      "file": "c015.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.344
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "我很高兴摆脱了尼古丁疾病。",
      "file": "c016.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.4
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c017.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "吸烟不再是我生活或身份的一部分。",
      "file": "c018.ogg",
      "durationSec": 6.144
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c019.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "我之所以有这些触发，是因为过去的记忆或看到其他吸烟者。",
      "file": "c020.ogg",
      "durationSec": 9.6
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c021.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "这些诱因对我无能为力，因为我已经摆脱了成瘾的奴役。",
      "file": "c022.ogg",
      "durationSec": 8.808
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "[暂停:22]",
      "file": "c023.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.512
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "我为那些仍被困在吸烟欺骗中的吸烟者感到遗憾。",
      "file": "c024.ogg",
      "durationSec": 7.368
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "他们被困在尼古丁耗尽、渴望和补给的痛苦循环中。",
      "file": "c025.ogg",
      "durationSec": 8.088
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c026.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "我不再像他们一样受苦。",
      "file": "c027.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.104
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "[暂停:14]",
      "file": "c028.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.416
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "现在我知道真相了。",
      "file": "c029.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.936
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "吸烟绝对没有任何好处。",
      "file": "c030.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.92
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c031.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "尿检棒从未帮助过任何人，也永远不会。",
      "file": "c032.ogg",
      "durationSec": 7.32
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c033.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "吸烟给我带来了许多问题。",
      "file": "c034.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.112
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "[暂停:14]",
      "file": "c035.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.416
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "我做出了我一生中最好的决定，再也不吸那令人作呕的毒物了。",
      "file": "c036.ogg",
      "durationSec": 8.592
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "这个决定是最终的。",
      "file": "c037.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.056
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "[暂停:22]",
      "file": "c038.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.512
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "现在，我尊重吸烟法则。",
      "file": "c039.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.568
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "[暂停:18]",
      "file": "c040.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "现在，我所有的情况都在变好。",
      "file": "c041.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.928
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "我变得越来越快乐、健康和自信。",
      "file": "c042.ogg",
      "durationSec": 6.624
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "[暂停:22]",
      "file": "c043.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.512
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "我自由了。",
      "file": "c044.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.096
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "[暂停:28]",
      "file": "c045.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.536
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "在自由中静心呼吸几下。",
      "file": "c046.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.568
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "触发因素可能仍会像旧记忆一样来访。",
      "file": "c047.ogg",
      "durationSec": 6.648
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "它们无法将你带回奴役状态。",
      "file": "c048.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.896
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "[暂停:36]",
      "file": "c049.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.632
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "我现在是一个不吸烟的人。",
      "file": "c050.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.2
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "我自由了。",
      "file": "c051.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.096
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "[暂停:28]",
      "file": "c052.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.536
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "再轻松地呼吸一次。",
      "file": "c053.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.008
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "活动一下手指。",
      "file": "c054.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.768
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "当你准备好了，睁开眼睛。",
      "file": "c055.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.776
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "带着这份自由前行。",
      "file": "c056.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.392
    }
  ]
}
